'기울기 = 1/m 이므로 m ≈ {0} kg':['Slope = 1/m, so m ≈ {0} kg','Pendiente = 1/m, así que m ≈ {0} kg','Pente = 1/m, donc m ≈ {0} kg','Steigung = 1/m, also m ≈ {0} kg','傾き = 1/m なので m ≈ {0} kg'],
